  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 102.02 Staff. The board shall utilize the resources of the office of professional licensure and certification as necessary to conduct the board’s daily operations and to fulfill its statutory duties.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
